# Coolify builds each app from its own folder (backend/ or frontend/), which has its own
# .dockerignore. This file only matters if an image is ever built from the repository root.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.rdb
.git
.github
